paragraphs.text:
@Gmail Find emails from the last 7 days that ask me to reply, decide or send something.
For each one, give me the sender, what they need and by when.
Sort them by deadline, soonest first.

@Google Calendar What is my next meeting with [name]?
@Drive Find the latest documents that mention [project].
Give me a five line briefing: what the meeting is about, what changed since we last met, and two questions I should ask.
